{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:847519e4707fb963bec4e76b37ed9adb9c247b75028c33697974c2526e13b376",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f695ebdff3ce63cb2cc9efc2184cbb8f47e3d57c6b0304a08f7ca5c188c54706",
      "text": "秘密的生日大作战！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36f9d8a5b5d6878ed91258f8edd82201b4ec42733d1828e2616531e2f0d4f287",
      "text": "直央的生日快到了。\n花音和志狼拉上制作人，\n开始了“生日大作战”。\n生日当天，毫不知情的直央在事务所里\n发现的东西是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:619138f143332c8667aa9f8a13adaa657c64ca47e95e8153ef4bd3bc28267373",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿。生日会的事直央君\n好像还没发现呢。作战其一，感觉很顺利！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6a8af8b3cd5e975c70893be284c7e8272f557e320a5091b98d84209a834b18a",
      "text": "噢！礼物也准备得妥妥当当的。\n作战其二也超级顺利！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3beede95ec9821d8ac7b80186867d29e98bb5d088775fa79c02064d97d5063e",
      "text": "蛋糕和饮料也拜托制作人\n帮忙准备好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75a59439cfc6ad2c41b0ad8bfaa43cfaaccc5cd6525b092e29fc3f25ee735711",
      "text": "接下来只要等直央找到信、走到休息室来就行！\n嘿嘿，他什么时候会来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b9be59a92309c67db6d1a78c081a3a117c1c34045ec0ed6888eb48102fe1139",
      "text": "我特意用了可爱的小兔子信封，\n他肯定马上就能发现的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49c98d741ea27a0980b82df5570fba7ae235c3689b83584c57081bb6d57104be",
      "text": "嘿嘿。直央一来我就狠狠地\n拉响礼花筒，超级期待的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c423a1a7e96d733b6293a0814d2fd51f6990b3399aa3fc9222146f507aae653",
      "text": "志狼君为了今天，\n还特意去了一趟将棋俱乐部啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c21f69db65569010aa719c979f6913b8c3c5613f97d0eecb1b5b196f94dd3b8d",
      "text": "对啊。既然直央之前一直都不知道，\n说明他们好好遵守了保守秘密的约定啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9392d08a44505642accc71aa7a3d33ec746e5b14723c8f31eaea7f40a2aca67",
      "text": "大家都是很好的人……我也承蒙关照了很久，\n是个能开开心心下将棋的地方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d8285dd614a79085a804232e74c4cef9556c8b63bd633983f5540edb6c54a8d",
      "text": "哦，大家都给了好多零食，\n再去玩玩也未尝不可啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f82392640850b76d05e0c8b42192c56c5ad108670adaf80009b51d2e5155aebc",
      "text": "真的吗？那下次我们、志狼君\n和花音君3个人一起去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f4318f1e3bfd3cbd3ad503d0ef129fbb2150cfca5fcd455a5b786a0683560a2",
      "text": "原来将棋还有那么多玩法啊。\n有些连花音都能马上学会呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c11d9c10fe083073ec05aa17e2dffe0a66049246e32f77d58211d1ebe9d840",
      "text": "是啊，将棋除了正规对弈之外还有别的玩法哦。\n你能了解到这些我也好开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8bdabb34c406e4cd1b80ec4b1ea7d2b79b1cefc14b70b0890aa9a5afbacd974",
      "text": "还有比旋转将棋更简单的呢。\n比如山崩啊、叠将棋之类的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34081b09674dda5d9dbf61d551436602773d1a2bf618445fff2256690ca39f91",
      "text": "诶～！这么说来，我还听说过\n像黑白棋或者多米诺骨牌一样的玩法呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:076547f86216b85dedf29dc624f97d9b0ffd17c4bf28eb583a291da18113a293",
      "text": "要是不介意的话，下次大家一起试试吧。\n规则由我来教你。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
